# Errata: the known anomalies of the terminal programs, with what is known of
# each cause and what to do.  A guide of its own, in the manner of Getting
# Started: it has a title block and no number on its sections, and it is not
# part of the Reference Manual.  The list is short and grows; an entry says
# what is seen, what is known and what is not, and what to do.
.doc Strata: Errata
.numbering off
